    "total_seconds": 38.5,
    "hook_moment": {"event_id": "E030-007", "what": "Elder Nobleman: \"You have a rat in your cellar, Rupert. And the servants are beginning to smell it.\""},
    "cliffhanger": {"event_id": "E030-023", "what": "Elder Nobleman: \"We stop hiding the prisoner.\""},
    "stranger_question": "Who is the \"rat\" in the cellar, and what will they do now they've decided to stop hiding her?",
    "why": "Opens on a cold accusation that a imprisoned woman is a \"rat\" to be exterminated; escalates through a cane-to-the-throat threat to burn her, and ends on the order to move against her openly.",
    "funnel": "premise",
    "safety": {"level": "mild", "reason": "Cane pressed to throat; explicit threat to \"burn\" a person (\"you burn them\")."}
  },
  {
    "title": "manufacture_the_evidence",
    "segments": [{"first_event": "E030-027", "last_event": "E030-049", "start_s": 51.2, "end_s": 101.8, "seconds": 50.6}],
    "total_seconds": 50.6,
    "hook_moment": {"event_id": "E030-027", "what": "Elder Nobleman: \"We give them a reason to condemn her.\""},
    "cliffhanger": {"event_id": "E030-049", "what": "Elder Nobleman: \"Drag her before the magistrate tomorrow, frame the trial, buy the jury, and let the State hang her.\""},
    "stranger_question": "Will they really manufacture evidence to hang an innocent woman tomorrow?",
    "why": "Cold open on the decision to frame her; escalates through the witchcraft pivot to a full execution order with a tomorrow deadline.",
    "funnel": "midarc",
    "safety": {"level": "none", "reason": "Verbal conspiracy only; no violence shown."}
  },
  {
    "title": "call_it_witchcraft",
    "segments": [{"first_event": "E030-043", "last_event": "E030-067", "start_s": 85.8, "end_s": 143.5, "seconds": 57.7}],
    "total_seconds": 57.7,
    "hook_moment": {"event_id": "E030-043", "what": "Elder Nobleman: \"Then call it witchcraft.\""},
    "cliffhanger": {"event_id": "E030-067", "what": "Elder Nobleman: \"Tomorrow, she stops being a prisoner. She becomes a witch.\""},
    "stranger_question": "Can she survive a witchcraft trial designed to execute her?",
    "why": "The hook is the villain's playbook distilled to four words; the climax brands her a witch with a tomorrow deadline.",
    "funnel": "payoff",
    "safety": {"level": "none", "reason": "Verbal threats and capital charge discussed; no on-screen violence."}
  },
  {
    "title": "tomorrow_she_burns",
